      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1314289101,
      "text": "Licuala spinosa, also known as the mangrove fan palm, is a species of palm in the genus Licuala. The plant is native to the wet places of fresh and salt water of Southeast Asia."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Licuala spinosa",
